Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:15.00,Title,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}🎵 나 같은 죄인 살리신 (새찬송가 305장) - 비컴퍼니 전주\N{\fnArial\fs48\b1\c&H00D4E7FE&}Amazing Grace (Hymn 305) - Intro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:36.50,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}[1절] 나 같은 죄인 살리신 주 은혜 놀라워\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}Amazing grace! how sweet the sound That saved a wretch like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:58.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}잃었던 생명 찾았고 광명을 얻었네\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}I once was lost, but now am found, Was blind, but now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:15.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}[2절] 큰 죄악에서 건지신 주 은혜 고마워\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}'Twas grace that taught my heart to fear, And grace my fears relieved;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:41.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}나 처음 믿은 그 시간 귀하고 귀하다\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}How precious did that grace appear The hour I first believed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:02:13.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}[3절] 이제껏 내가 산 것도 주님의 은혜라\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}Through many dangers, toils and snares, I have already come;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:32.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}또 나를 장차 본향에 인도해 주시리\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}'Tis grace hath brought me safe thus far, And grace will lead me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:52.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}[4절] 거기서 우리 영원히 주님의 은혜로\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}When we've been there ten thousand years, Bright shining as the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:03:11.00,Korean,,0,0,130,,{\fade(400,400)}해처럼 밝게 살면서 주 찬양 하리라\N{\fnArial\fs52\b1\c&H0070DCFE&}We've no less days to sing God's praise Than when we'd first begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:36.00,Title,,0,0,130,,{\fade(500,800)}아멘~~~\N{\fnArial\fs48\b1\c&H00D4E7FE&}Amen~~
